---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHead from '../components/PageHead.astro';
import { site, indirizzoRiga } from '../data/site';

const crumbs = [{ name: 'Home', href: '/' }, { name: 'Privacy policy', href: '/privacy-policy/' }];
// DA VERIFICARE: VAT number and legal name (site.piva, site.ragioneSociale) not public on the site — rendered only once provided.
---
<Layout title={`Privacy policy | ${site.nome}`} description={`Information on the processing of personal data for the ${site.nome} website.`} crumbs={crumbs}>
<PageHead crumbs={crumbs} title="Privacy policy"> <p class="lead mt-2">Information pursuant to articles 13 and 14 of Regulation (EU) 2016/679 (GDPR).</p> </PageHead>
<section class="section"> <div class="container narrow prose"> <h2>Data controller</h2> <p>{site.ragioneSociale || site.nome}, {indirizzoRiga} ({site.indirizzo.provincia}){site.piva && <> — VAT {site.piva}</>} — email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>{site.pec && <>, PEC {site.pec}</>}{site.telefono && <>, tel. {site.telefono}</>}.</p> <h2>Data processed</h2> <p><strong>Browsing data.</strong> The IT systems running the site acquire, in their normal operation, some technical data (IP address, browser type, date and time of the request) needed to deliver the pages and ensure their security. This data is not used to identify users.</p> <p><strong>Data provided voluntarily.</strong> By using the contact form or writing to the studio's email address, the user provides their name, email, any phone number and address and the content of the message.</p> <h2>Purposes and legal basis</h2> <ul> <li>Responding to requests for information and quotes (pre-contractual measures requested by the data subject, art. 6.1.b GDPR).</li> <li>Ensuring the operation and security of the site (legitimate interest, art. 6.1.f GDPR).</li> </ul> <h2>Retention</h2> <p>Data sent through the form is kept for the time needed to handle the request and, if an engagement arises, for the period required by legal obligations.</p> <h2>Recipients</h2> <p>Data is processed by the studio and by the technical providers that host the site and handle form submissions, appointed as data processors. Data is not disclosed or sold to third parties for marketing purposes.</p> <h2>Rights of the data subject</h2> <p>You may at any time request access to your data, its rectification, erasure, restriction or objection to processing, and portability, by writing to <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>. You may also lodge a complaint with the Italian Data Protection Authority (www.garanteprivacy.it).</p> <h2>Cookies</h2> <p>For the use of cookies, please refer to the <a href="/cookie-policy/">cookie policy</a>.</p> </div> </section>
</Layout>
